00:08:17,142 --> 00:08:23,142
Black Belt Jones is a action, comedy, crime film directed by Robert Clouse.

3
00:12:25,714 --> 00:12:31,714
Jones is a secret agent who has gone into semi-retirement, concentrating
instead on teaching the martial arts to inner city youths.

4
00:16:34,285 --> 00:16:40,285
The karate school is run by a kindly old coot named Pops.

5
00:20:42,857 --> 00:20:48,857
His gambling debts, however, bring the local thug, Pinky, down on him.

6
00:24:51,428 --> 00:24:57,428
To make matters worse, Pinky is then hired by some white thugs who want to get a hold of
the property Pops' school occupies so they can build a shopping mall.

7
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:06,000
When things get heavy, Black Belt Jones leaps into action.

8
00:33:08,571 --> 00:33:14,571
Only he's not alone.

9
00:37:17,142 --> 00:37:23,142
Pops' daughter, Sidney, shows up to lend a hand, proving herself every
bit as agile and powerful a martial artist as Jones.

10
