01:06:17,142 --> 01:06:23,142
Black Belt Jones is a 1974 American blaxploitation martial arts film directed
by Robert Clouse and starring Jim Kelly and Gloria Hendry.

17
01:10:25,714 --> 01:10:31,714
The film is a spiritual successor to Clouse's prior film Enter
the Dragon, in which Kelly had a supporting role.

18
01:14:34,285 --> 01:14:40,285
Here, Kelly features in his first starring role as the eponymous character, a local hero
who fights the Mafia and a local drug dealer threatening his friend's dojo.

19
01:18:42,857 --> 01:18:48,857
The film explores themes of martial arts, blaxploitation cinema, black belt.

20
01:22:51,428 --> 01:22:57,428
The tone is lighthearted.
